Package: vos-calendar
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: month and day calendar application for V\OS
 Calendar is a month/day calendar application with event and category
 management, notifications, iCalendar import and an optional remote
 event sync. Events live in a local SQLite database; the first day of
 the week follows the locale rules from the localisation kit.
